B.eRq=new A.y("Breathing","A dome-shaped muscle under your lungs. It pulls down to suck air in. A hiccup is it twitching.")
B.eVb=new A.y("Digestion","Cleans your blood and stores energy. It is the only organ that can grow back after damage.")
